  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICT Investment Analysis, through Global Resources, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study of the potential, impact, and viability of the City of Cape Town investments in five information and communication technology (ICT) areas: (1) enabling infrastructure; (2) intelligent transportation systems; (3) safety and security; (4) digital inclusion infrastructure; and (5) digital literacy. The feasibility study supports exports of U.S. goods and services for priority ICT and smart city projects that will increase access to affordable, reliable telecommunication services and improve the efficiency and quality of municipal services in Cape Town, South Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
